### Create order
# @name create-order
POST {{base_url}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

item=sku-1&qty=2&note=gift+wrap+%26+bow&password={{shop_api_password}}&user={{username}}

### Upload receipt
# @name upload-receipt
# The formdata body is not imported
POST {{base_url}}/orders/7/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search orders (GraphQL)
# @name search-orders-graphql
# The graphql body is not imported
POST {{base_url}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Log in
# @name log-in
POST {{base_url}}/login
Authorization: Basic {{shop_api_basic}}

### Log in as user
# @name log-in-as-user
# Basic auth: set shop_api_basic-2 to the base64 encoding of username:password (in Postman, from {{username}} and {{password}})
POST {{base_url}}/login
Authorization: Basic {{shop_api_basic-2}}
